            {
              "$type": "localizationPersistenceOnScreenEntry",
              "femaleVariant": "Blood",
              "maleVariant": "",
              "primaryKey": "0",
              "secondaryKey": "cc-g04-clue-blood-name"
            },
            {
              "$type": "localizationPersistenceOnScreenEntry",
              "femaleVariant": "A few drops by the back doors. A split lip or a broken nose, not a gunshot.",
              "maleVariant": "",
              "primaryKey": "0",
              "secondaryKey": "cc-g04-clue-blood-desc"
            },
            {
              "$type": "localizationPersistenceOnScreenEntry",
              "femaleVariant": "Handcuffs",
              "maleVariant": "",
              "primaryKey": "0",
              "secondaryKey": "cc-g04-clue-cuffs-name"
            },
            {
              "$type": "localizationPersistenceOnScreenEntry",
              "femaleVariant": "Unlocked, not cut. They took them off him before they moved him.",
              "maleVariant": "",
              "primaryKey": "0",
              "secondaryKey": "cc-g04-clue-cuffs-desc"
            },
            {
              "$type": "localizationPersistenceOnScreenEntry",
              "femaleVariant": "Duffel bag",
              "maleVariant": "",
              "primaryKey": "0",
              "secondaryKey": "cc-g04-clue-bag-name"
            },
            {
              "$type": "localizationPersistenceOnScreenEntry",
              "femaleVariant": "R. MANALO on the tag. They took it from the stall with him. Inside, folded, an Orbital Air janitor's coveralls.",
              "maleVariant": "",
              "primaryKey": "0",
              "secondaryKey": "cc-g04-clue-bag-desc"
            },
            {
              "$type": "localizationPersistenceOnScreenEntry",
              "femaleVariant": "Stamps' shard",
              "maleVariant": "",
              "primaryKey": "0",
              "secondaryKey": "cc-g04-shard-item"
            },
            {
              "$type": "localizationPersistenceOnScreenEntry",
              "femaleVariant": "Left on the seat of a couch in the alley behind Kabuki Market.",
              "maleVariant": "",
              "primaryKey": "0",
              "secondaryKey": "cc-g04-shard-item-desc"
            },
            {
              "$type": "localizationPersistenceOnScreenEntry",
              "femaleVariant": "MESSAGES // STAMPS",
              "maleVariant": "",
              "primaryKey": "0",
              "secondaryKey": "cc-g04-shard-title"
            },
            {
              "$type": "localizationPersistenceOnScreenEntry",
              "femaleVariant": "KAZ: You still owe me for last week. Pay that and the stool is yours.\n\nSTAMPS: Got paid today. Pour the good stuff. On my way.",
              "maleVariant": "",
              "primaryKey": "0",
              "secondaryKey": "cc-g04-shard-body"
            },
            {
              "$type": "localizationPersistenceOnScreenEntry",
              "femaleVariant": "Tyger Claws' shard",
              "maleVariant": "",
              "primaryKey": "0",
              "secondaryKey": "cc-g04-shard2-item"
            },
            {
              "$type": "localizationPersistenceOnScreenEntry",
              "femaleVariant": "Found behind the Tyger Claws' van in Little China.",
              "maleVariant": "",
              "primaryKey": "0",
              "secondaryKey": "cc-g04-shard2-item-desc"
            },
            {
              "$type": "localizationPersistenceOnScreenEntry",
              "femaleVariant": "MESSAGES // JUNICHI",
              "maleVariant": "",
              "primaryKey": "0",
              "secondaryKey": "cc-g04-shard2-title"
            },
            {
              "$type": "localizationPersistenceOnScreenEntry",
              "femaleVariant": "JUNICHI: Moving the janitor now. Stamps knows about the van, and Stamps talks to anyone who pays.\n\nHIROKI: Where to?\n\nJUNICHI: The shop in Little China. Shutters down, double doors on the street. Keep him there till their team comes.",
              "maleVariant": "",
              "primaryKey": "0",
              "secondaryKey": "cc-g04-shard2-body"
            },
            {
              "$type": "localizationPersistenceOnScreenEntry",
              "femaleVariant": "Gig type: SOS: Merc Needed\nObjective: Find Reynaldo Manalo and get him out\nLocation: Maricel Manalo's noodle stall, Kabuki Market\nDetails:\n\nReynaldo Manalo signed with Orbital Air for fifteen years, to clean rooms on the Crystal Palace. The flight up and the rent in the workers' hotel come out of the salary. After seven years he owed more than on the day he signed.\n\nAn old friend of mine, Liban, got him down to Night City in cargo. He hid at his sister's stall in Kabuki Market. Last night the Tyger Claws took him. If Orbital Air gets him, he goes back up.\n\nHis sister Maricel is the client. Her picture is attached. Nobody knows where he is, so start with her. She knows you're coming.\n\nOrbital Air will send people for him. Get him out first. I will call you once he is safe. Location attached.",
              "maleVariant": "",
              "primaryKey": "0",
              "secondaryKey": "cc-g04-msg-brief"
            },
            {
              "$type": "localizationPersistenceOnScreenEntry",
              "femaleVariant": "His sister called. He's out of Night City. My friend drove him out tonight. Well done, V. Your fee will be in your account shortly. Take care.",
              "maleVariant": "",
              "primaryKey": "0",
              "secondaryKey": "cc-g04-msg-close"
            },
            {
              "$type": "localizationPersistenceOnScreenEntry",
              "femaleVariant": "His sister called. He's out of Night City. My friend drove him out tonight. Stamps is dead. Maricel still has to live in that market. Well done, V. Your fee will be in your account shortly. Take care.",
              "maleVariant": "",
              "primaryKey": "0",
              "secondaryKey": "cc-g04-msg-close-dead"
            }
          ]
        }
